# The release archives are built from the working tree, so their checksums
# depend on the line endings on disk. CI builds them on Linux, and the release
# workflow refuses to publish if its rebuild disagrees with metadata.json, so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf on would produce an archive that can never
# match. Normalise on checkout instead of teaching build.py to paper over it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
